Malcolm Ryan wrote:
> As the next step in my ongoing project to add an Alchemist class to the
> game, I am creating the Philosopher's Stone. My aim is to produce an
> artifact which promotes the use of alchemy without replacing it. I'm
> currently considering:
> 
> * It gives hungerless regen when carried (giving "eternal youth")
> 
> Malcolm
> 
I prefer, when carried you are immune to any effects from potions. 
Thusly, the Alchemist could wield and hit various monsters with any 
potion -- sleeping, paralysis, sickness, blindness, confusion, etc -- 
and not feel the effects. (This would be most effective if two potions 
of full healing killed Death.)

This of course means you cannot use !oFH to heal yourself in combat...


